title: Add RFC-17 coretime market pallet

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds pallet-coretime-market, an RFC-17 implementation of the Market trait
      introduced in paritytech/polkadot-sdk#11563.

      The pallet implements a clearing-price descending Dutch auction with three phases
      per sale cycle: Market (bidding), Renewal (existing tenants exercise renewal rights),
      and Settlement (regions issued, awaiting next rotation).

      Key design points: uniform clearing price for all winners, binding bids (raise only),
      exponential reserve price adjustment, tenant displacement protection, and auction wins
      reducing renewal quota per RFC-17.

crates:
  - name: pallet-coretime-market
    bump: patch
  - name: fp-coretime
    bump: minor
  - name: polkadot-sdk
    bump: minor
